error[parse/plain-type-hint-unsupported]: hints are not allowed on a plain type definition
  ┌─ parse/parse-hint-on-plain.watsup:4:18
  │
4 │ syntax foo = nat hint(blah)
  │                  ^^^^^^^^^^ plain types inherit their hints
  │
  = A plain type definition aliases an existing type, as in `syntax x = nat`. It inherits the aliased type's hints and cannot declare its own.

